sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant C as C Session Owner
    participant Outbox as Device Command Adapter
    participant IOT as External IoT Simulator
    participant D as D07 Verified Event
    Student->>C: requestStart(sessionId)
    C->>C: START_PENDING; persist intent and command
    C->>Outbox: enqueue requestStart
    Outbox->>IOT: send device command after commit
    IOT-->>D: status and ACK (sourceId,eventId)
    D->>D: validate and save inbox receipt
    D-->>C: getVerifiedEvent(sourceId,eventId)
    C->>C: applyVerifiedEvent once
    alt matching verified start
        C->>C: CHARGING
    else missing or conflicting evidence
        C->>C: keep pending or mark exception
    end
    Note over C,IOT: STOP_PENDING and physical UNPLUGGED are distinct states
